      "phase": 2,
      "name": "Market and volume hard filters",
      "what": "Requires market cap of at least $300M, price above $1, real trading liquidity and history; no SPACs. Chatter must be unusual (z-score), come from many different users (70%+ unique), and be confirmed by real trading volume. Fundamentals: positive P/E up to 60, growing revenue, debt/equity up to 200%."
